
An automated AI-powered news research workflow that collects articles from news APIs, filters and summarizes relevant topics using an AI Agent, customizes the output, and delivers the final intelligence brief through Telegram.

The workflow is designed to turn a large stream of information into a focused, personalized news feed.

## 💼 Business Problem

Businesses and individuals often spend significant time manually:

* Searching multiple news sources
* Filtering irrelevant stories
* Reading lengthy articles
* Summarizing information
* Preparing daily briefings
* Sharing relevant updates with teams

This workflow automates that process.

## ⚙️ Workflow Architecture

```text
Scheduled Trigger
       ↓
    News APIs
       ↓
  Article Collection
       ↓
    AI Agent
       ↓
Topic Selection & Filtering
       ↓
   AI Summarization
       ↓
 Custom Instructions
       ↓
 Personalized Output
       ↓
     Telegram
       ↓
Original Article Links
```

## 🛠️ Tools Used

* n8n
* News APIs
* AI Agent
* LLM
* Telegram
* Scheduled automation

## 🔑 Key Steps

1. Trigger the workflow on a defined schedule
2. Fetch the latest news and article data through APIs
3. Pass the collected information to the AI Agent
4. Identify the most relevant topics
5. Filter unwanted or low-value information
6. Summarize selected articles
7. Apply custom instructions to the final output
8. Format the news briefing
9. Send the result to Telegram
10. Include the original article links for source verification

