## 🔧 Customization

The workflow can be customized by changing:

* News sources
* APIs
* Topics and keywords
* AI Agent instructions
* Filtering criteria
* Summary format
* Delivery channels
* Scheduling frequency

Additional business systems can also be connected through n8n to turn the intelligence feed into downstream actions.

